<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish Sept industrial output falls 3.1 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Irish Sept industrial output falls 3.1 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish industrial output fell a seasonally adjusted 3.1 percent in September and was down 0.2 percent year-on-year, Central Statistics Office (CSO)data showed on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Manufacturing production fell 1.6 percent over the month and was down 0.9 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>		   Manufacturing  Transportable  All industries</p>
